      "writtenOn": "2022-04-20T19:42:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "getCurrentUser() returns the foreground user, which is typically 0 on phones (but could be other users).\n\nA work profile - or any profile - runs \"concurrently\" with its parent user (which is also typically 0). So, if it\u0027s an app in the work profile that\u0027s making this call,  getCallingUserHandle().getIdentifier() \u003d\u003d ActivityManager.getCurrentUser() would fail...",
